intense|PASS: Concentration illustrates strength without inventing a scientific claim. Vietnamese cao độ fits the collocation; the intensive contrast is qualified by usually rather than an absolute prohibition.
privilege|PASS: Exclusive workshop access and appreciated literary opportunity are distinct source-supported noun boundaries. Vietnamese distinguishes đặc quyền from vinh dự; the latter makes no legal entitlement claim.
submit|PASS: Transitive document delivery and intransitive submission to authority keep different complements. Submitted spelling and both source ordinals are checked; the rebel narrative translates resistance faithfully.
workout|PASS: A single exercise session is countable and distinguished from the two-word verb. Packing a mat away avoids a promised health benefit; the Vietnamese example preserves the sequence after exercise.
creative|PASS: Imaginative use of stage shadows supports the adjective without requiring an invented noun or creativity score. The example's apparent enlargement is faithfully rendered by có vẻ rộng hơn.
